{
  "note": "What scripts/sbkit.cjs reads out of the WebSDK UI kit's Storybook: one entry per component, the stories whose CSS and markup are kept, and, for a component that renders only after a click, the trigger. `owns` pins a CSS module to the component: a class name the module has, or a list of names it must all have; the most specific pin wins. Without a pin the module goes to the component whose name a class carries, else to the one component whose stories show it, else to the earliest entry here — so the primitives (text, input, loader) come first.",
